Heisty Spideys — Foundry VTT System
Copyright (c) 2026 PainHog. All rights reserved.

This repository contains two kinds of material:

1. SOFTWARE — the Foundry VTT system code (everything under module/, styles/,
   templates/, tools/, assets/, and the manifest files).

2. GAME CONTENT — the text of the game "Heisty Spideys" reproduced in the
   compendiums and source data (src/packs/ and the compiled packs/), including
   the rules, the five ready-to-run heists, the creatures, and all associated
   writing.

